    "en": "Factors in choosing a form"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "The choice depends on the cost and ease of setting up, the liability the owners can accept, the need for continuity, the management ability required, the capital needed, the degree of control the owners want, and the nature of the business. No single form is best for every business."
   },
